# Git (and GitHub) keeps the program only: never your own files, anything the app makes, or Claude's notes.
# (Each line is a pattern: a name ending in "/" is a folder.)

# the Python environment setup.bat makes, and Python's and Ruff's caches
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ruff_cache/

# your settings, the app's log and setup's log; your files and what the app writes
data/
inputs/
output/
presets/
downloads/
# installers and zips made by the "Make ..." launchers
releases/

# Claude Code's files (its notes, settings and skills) and the git guide: on this PC only
.claude/
GIT-GUIDE.md
